From eff9e5f00c4539c10ef0f9b10f6e2f8ad9f674d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stel777 <274792865+Stel777@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 10 Jun 2026 11:24:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 02/11] feat(ssd): auto-open NeuroVault on SSD connect with
 loading splash

Watcher detects the brain SSD by marker file and launches the app on the connect transition. Adds a transparent WPF loading ring (fill style, NeuroVault mark centered) shown the instant the SSD is plugged in, covering the tauri dev build and self-closing when the app window appears. Includes register/eject helper scripts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
